    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n62782" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λευρός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ά</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span> (also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ός</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>
		<i><span class="en">
			A.
			<u>Pr.</u>
			371
		</span></i>), poet. Adj.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>smooth, level, even</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λευρῷ ἐνὶ χώρῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					7.123
				</span></i>
			, Orac. ap. <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.67
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Σικελίας λευροὺς γύας</span>
			A.l.c.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λ. οἶμος αἰθέρος</span>
				ib.<i><span class="en">
				396
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν ψαμάθῳ λευρᾷ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Hec.</u>
					700
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πέδον, πέτρα</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Ph.</u>
				836
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ba.</u>
				982
			</span></i> (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁδοί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Call.
					<u>Aet.Oxy.</u>
					2080.67
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>smooth, polished</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξίφος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>N.</u>
					7.27
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δέρμα . . λευρὸν ἔθηκε</span>
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βοός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					6.116
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">Samus</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λευρᾶς σωφροσύνης: τελείας, καὶ ταπεινῆς,
				κοίλης, ὁμαλῆς, μὴ τραχείας</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i></div>
